The Core Idea (Refined)

Most data platforms show you what happened. Your platform shows you what it means for your life right now — blending environmental, social, economic, and behavioral signals into actionable personal KPIs. Think of it like a GPS for life decisions, where yellow/red/green indicators tell you the quality of a moment, not just traffic.

The Signal Fusion Engine (How It Works)

The magic is in combining 3+ weak signals into 1 strong insight. Like your GPS analogy — no single input tells the whole story, but together they do.

